    ]
   },
   "do": [{"do": "defeat", "text": "The village ran out of food and starved."}]
  },
  {
   "id": "1.1", "when": {"type": "start"},
   "do": [
    {
     "do": "cutscene", "id": "hungry_spring", "at": [124, 22],
     "lines": [
      ["Chronicler", "I was at Orsha and heard the guns roar. What I write below I heard from my grandfather, and he from his father. What is true here and what is a tale, judge for yourselves."],
      ["Chronicler", "That year Samogitia was German. Vytautas gave it to the Order by treaty, and nobody asked us. Last winter there was hunger. King Jogaila sent us grain down the river, but the Germans stopped the boats and said they would feed Samogitia themselves."],
      ["Chronicler", "Our great-grandfather Gintaut was neither prince nor lord. A boyar with three farmsteads, one horse and one grove where his grandfathers still prayed. And in the spring of fourteen hundred and nine he decided he would bear it no longer."],
      ["hero_gintaut", "Bread first. Then the Germans."]
     ]
    },
    {"do": "objective", "id": "food", "text": "Gather 300 food so the village lives through the summer"},
    {"do": "dialogue", "lines": [["hero_gintaut", "There are fish in the lake and honey in the hives. The Germans cannot search the whole forest."]]},
    {"do": "hint", "text": "Move the camera with the arrow keys or the screen edge. Drag to select units."},
    {"do": "hint", "text": "Select peasants and right-click game to hunt. Fields by the forest and hives in it give food too."}
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "1.2", "when": {"type": "built", "player": 1, "base": "house"},
   "do": [{"do": "hint", "text": "A house feeds more mouths. Train peasants at the yard and build a granary near the food."}]
  },
  {
   "id": "1.3",
   "when": {
    "type": "any",
    "of": [{"type": "after", "trigger": "1.1", "ticks": 4800}, {"type": "stock", "player": 1, "res": "food", "at_least": 150}]
   },
   "do": [
    {
     "do": "spawn", "group": "tithe", "player": 2, "at": [113, 58], "stance": "passive", "untouchable": true,
     "units": [["to_tithe_collector", 1], ["to_knecht", 4]]
    },
    {"do": "move", "group": "tithe", "to": [124, 27]},
    {"do": "hint", "text": "The Order's tithe collector is coming up the road."}
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "1.3b", "when": {"type": "group_near", "group": "tithe", "at": [124, 27], "radius": 5},
   "do": [
    {"do": "take_stock", "player": 1, "res": "food", "permille": 500},
    {
     "do": "dialogue", "id": "tithe",
     "lines": [
      ["Collector", "The lord vogt demands grain for the castles. You wanted to be protected, did you not?"],
      ["hero_gintaut", "From whom?"],
      ["Collector", "From the darkness you live in. Half of it. And all the rye."]
     ]
    },
    {"do": "hint", "text": "Your people are not ready to fight yet. Gather your stores again."},
    {"do": "move", "group": "tithe", "to": [100, 116]},
    {"do": "exit", "group": "tithe", "at": [100, 116], "radius": 3}
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "1.4",
   "when": {"type": "all", "of": [{"type": "fired", "trigger": "1.3b"}, {"type": "stock", "player": 1, "res": "food", "at_least": 300}]},
   "do": [
    {"do": "objective", "id": "food", "state": "done"},
    {
     "do": "cutscene", "id": "oaks_fall", "at": [80, 76],
     "lines": [
      ["Messenger", "Lord Gintaut, the Germans are in our grove. They are building a house for their god, and our oaks are going for logs."],
      ["hero_gintaut", "They took the bread, now the grove. Take up your spears."]
     ]
    },
    {"do": "objective", "id": "grove", "text": "Take back the sacred grove and lay an alka there"},
    {"do": "ping", "at": [80, 76], "radius": 8}
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "2.1",
   "when": {"type": "all", "of": [{"type": "fired", "trigger": "1.4"}, {"type": "near", "player": 1, "at": [80, 76], "radius": 16}]},
   "do": [{"do": "hint", "text": "Archers among the trees are harder to hit. Let the spearmen hold the Order's men while your archers shoot from the forest."}]
  },
  {
   "id": "2.2",
   "when": {"type": "all", "of": [{"type": "fired", "trigger": "1.4"}, {"type": "destroyed", "building": "chapel"}]},
   "do": [
    {"do": "spawn", "group": "keeper", "player": 1, "at": [82, 78], "untouchable": true, "units": [["hero_keeper", 1]]},
    {
     "do": "dialogue", "id": "fire_under_ash",
     "lines": [
      ["hero_keeper", "You took your time, son of Gintaut. For three days I kept the fire in a pot, the way our old women carry it from house to house."],
      ["hero_gintaut", "They cut down the old oak."],
      ["hero_keeper", "An oak can be cut down. But the place where it grew is still here. Set stones in a circle, as your grandfather did, and the fire will come back."]
     ]
    },
    {"do": "unlock", "player": 1, "items": ["gdl_shrine"]},
    {"do": "hint", "text": "Keep your units on the place of power with no enemies near to take it. Then peasants can lay an alka on it."}
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "2.3",
   "when": {"type": "all", "of": [{"type": "fired", "trigger": "2.2"}, {"type": "built", "player": 1, "base": "shrine"}]},
   "do": [
    {"do": "objective", "id": "grove", "state": "done"},
    {"do": "flag", "flag": "show_power"},
    {"do": "unlock", "player": 1, "items": ["gdl_znakharka"]},
    {"do": "give_stock", "player": 1, "res": "silver", "amount": 60},
    {
     "do": "dialogue", "id": "alka_lit",
     "lines": [
      ["hero_keeper", "Now listen. The land gives strength to whoever holds it. The Germans have their own strength, from books and the bones of saints. We have ours: from groves, from water, from the stones where the gods stood. Send me girls who know herbs. I will teach them to call the mist."]
     ]
    },
    {"do": "hint", "text": "The alka gives Power. Every place of power you hold with an alka adds more; near the Order's castles and priests it gives less."},
    {"do": "objective", "id": "places", "optional": true, "text": "Take all 7 places of power"}
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "2.4",
   "when": {"type": "all", "of": [{"type": "fired", "trigger": "2.3"}, {"type": "has_unit", "player": 1, "unit": "gdl_znakharka"}]},
   "do": [
    {"do": "hint", "text": "The znakharka can call Bog Mist: your units in it cannot be seen until they attack."},
    {"do": "objective", "id": "spring", "optional": true, "text": "Lead forest archers past the Order's watch to the spring"}
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "2.4b",
   "when": {"type": "all", "of": [{"type": "fired", "trigger": "2.3"}, {"type": "cast", "player": 1, "spell": "sp_bog_mist"}]},
   "do": [
    {
     "do": "dialogue",
     "lines": [
      ["Chronicler", "They say the mist rose from the bog in broad daylight, and a German patrol passed ten steps from our men and saw no one. Such mists do happen in Samogitia. But grandfather said that one was special."]
     ]
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "2.4c",
   "when": {
    "type": "all",
    "of": [
     {"type": "fired", "trigger": "2.4"},
     {"type": "near", "player": 1, "unit": "gdl_forest_archer", "at": [113, 107], "radius": 4}
    ]
   },
   "do": [{"do": "objective", "id": "spring", "state": "done"}]
  },
  {
   "id": "places",
   "when": {"type": "all", "of": [{"type": "fired", "trigger": "2.3"}, {"type": "places_held", "player": 1, "count": 7}]},
   "do": [{"do": "objective", "id": "places", "state": "done"}]
  },
  {
   "id": "3.1", "when": {"type": "after", "trigger": "2.3", "ticks": 3600},
   "do": [
    {"do": "spawn", "group": "riders", "player": 1, "at": [154, 63], "units": [["hero_rumbaudas", 1], ["gdl_light_horse", 8]]},
    {"do": "move", "group": "riders", "to": [130, 46]},
    {
     "do": "cutscene", "id": "princes_man", "at": [150, 62],
     "lines": [
      ["hero_rumbaudas", "Are you the Gintaut who burned the chapel?"],
      ["hero_gintaut", "And whose man are you?"],
      ["hero_rumbaudas", "The prince's. Prince Vytautas has not sent us yet. But the Germans held back the king's grain, and now the prince says he did not send us far enough."],
      ["hero_rumbaudas", "Where is the nearest German castle?"],
      ["hero_gintaut", "Skirsnemune. A wooden one."],
      ["hero_rumbaudas", "Wood burns well."]
     ]
    },
    {"do": "unlock", "player": 1, "items": ["age_khorugv"]},
    {"do": "objective", "id": "burn", "text": "Burn the castle of Skirsnemune"},
    {"do": "objective", "id": "riders", "optional": true, "text": "Burn Skirsnemune without losing any of Rumbaudas's riders"},
    {"do": "boats", "on": true},
    {"do": "ping", "at": [100, 126], "radius": 10}
   ]
